{"games":[{"id":583507031,"name":"PAPERS, PLEASE! [❗UPDATE]","desc":"🌿💼 𝐖𝐄𝐋𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐄 𝐓𝐎 𝐓𝐇𝐄 𝐆𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐓𝐈𝐍 𝐅𝐄𝐃𝐄𝐑𝐀𝐋 𝐁𝐎𝐑𝐃𝐄𝐑!\nYour objective is to cross the heavily guarded border checkpoint - alive. Immigrate using your personal documents or attempt to sneak past the Border Guards. Or, rebel against the regime and fight back with EZIC to reclaim territory.\nReady to cross the line? Play now & shape your life.\n\nPapers, Please is a roleplay game where players attempt to immigrate into the fictional city of Grestin. Cross the imperialist fortress and work a job to get paid, or live a life of crime - sneak past border guards & steal from stores to make a living; it's up to you. Inspired by Lucas Pope's \"Papers Please\".\n\n💣 Purchase bundles and save on weapons and tools in-game: https://www.roblox.com/games/12349604659\n⚔️ Join the Military and begin your career in the Federation: https://www.roblox.com/groups/3029096\n📜 Stay up to date with game rules and guidelines: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/-/4174028","path":"/game/583507031-papers-please","slug":"583507031-papers-please","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7b3c81bfaad9e1793bb61b93c285996be3d76ff957253ac4506b4d807f4dcd01.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-539bf4090dff21309a15b96bc79ce64c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":41301368,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-31T21:44:22.661Z","creator":{"name":"Imperialist Robloxian Federation","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":171391948,"name":"[Sides] Vehicle Simulator","desc":"","path":"/game/171391948-vehicle-simulator","slug":"171391948-vehicle-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e77bb2a94951926cd7c9279aadcebea1447b8a2f663d47d4a5e6c8644ea1046d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e2b3484a57548b7ac1bf28a59970a2c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-02T22:15:21.731Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":402122991,"name":"Redwood Prison","desc":"Welcome to Redwood Correctional Facility.\r\n\r\nI put out an update that should stop everything from going green!\r\n\r\nNew in servers Version 1.428:\r\n- Added Four-Wheelers!\r\n- Prisoners now become hostile when entering helipad area\r\n- added option to remove hats with button or equals key\r\n- can't deal damage to helicopters driven by your own team\r\n- added ammo crates to refill ammo\r\n- new taser effects\r\n- you can now arrest people lying down\r\n- Added some more anti exploit stuff\r\n\r\nGive the game a thumbs up! It lets me know you guys want updates ;D","path":"/game/402122991-redwood-prison","slug":"402122991-redwood-prison","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/231e421d9859577ede6a75194c7801b22fcd5e28b1f1ea695f0c0db2cc42a7be.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f25b43b26d8e0ecf18e41f10cfc6f267/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":296065734,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T05:53:23.889Z","creator":{"name":"RoyStanford","type":"User"},"script":{"count":15,"freeCount":15,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":625364452,"name":"Foam FPS","desc":"PREMIUM BENIFITS: 1.5X Cash and XP boost in-game! \n\nFoam FPS is a foam flinging first person shooter where you tag your friends and foes in an ultimate foam flinging experience! You'll be able to customize between 40+ different guns and play on multiple maps and game modes! \n\nVersion 6.21\n8/12/2024 changelog:\n- Brought back character customizer\n- Store now has a PolicyService check, this means the game will be playable in stricter countries\n- Optimized bullet lag and trails\n- Fixed mobile jump button\n- Re-added FFA and Gun Game score UI\n- Adjusted blue v orange score UI \n\nI'm working at another roblox game studio, I was dev on the Jaws: Infested Waters experience, so this is still a side thing that I'm not going to update for very much longer.","path":"/game/625364452-foam-fps","slug":"625364452-foam-fps","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/47f82258c63447d9b06656a39379794f488d9bd48760c94b7fe1c375b3220cad.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-560fc888332b9b97b758687202518193/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":50510107,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-08T15:09:23.576Z","creator":{"name":"IsaacThePooper","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":648362523,"name":"Breaking Point","desc":"Update V8.2\r\n - Default theme\r\n - New command: !join mode-name (e.g. !join fr)\r\n - Fixes","path":"/game/648362523-breaking-point","slug":"648362523-breaking-point","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0f2a85f1ac120d297fb32cbb2b1c7ff83915b0aca77a0d664a98609abc4431c7.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0136eb65b94aeb8de7a1c8063ec9a5e5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1358381997,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-22T23:08:45.517Z","creator":{"name":"Paradox","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":31,"freeCount":30,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":3}},{"id":340809482,"name":"Classic: Limited Simulator","desc":"this game is no longer supported, bugs may be around","path":"/game/340809482-classic-limited-simulator","slug":"340809482-classic-limited-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5bf2fd3f2628410714b301dc8db6a6cc82b49ada45b298aa9a863dbe86b01237.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e1641fb96142d0593219ba0ddb881e36/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":11722651,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-03-23T08:35:30.912Z","creator":{"name":"Trade.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":1117315411,"name":"Adventure Story!","desc":"A multiplayer, turn-based action-adventure game set in a cartoony world full of interesting and charming characters. You travel the world to learn powerful abilities in order to conquer the most evil beings with the help of your friends, while collecting treasures and valuable relics along the way.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------\n\n2026 changes:\n- Fixed lots of issues, optimized some things, slight battle improvements\n- Reset dungeon ratings and fixed generation issues with it\n- Increased card drop rates from 1 in 8 to 1 in 2\n- Increased corrupted enemy rates when at max level\n- Fixed fleeing, made some battle camera movements faster\n- Dungeon difficulty is now total of player ratings instead of combined average\n- Dungeon rating on victory is no longer split between each player\n- Endless dungeons now scale faster based on number of players","path":"/game/1117315411-adventure-story","slug":"1117315411-adventure-story","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/3582b88df1cfc42930d03145000dafa31426258ba15dafcd022c65fdb35d25cf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e138e69056e4ab25dcef8c5694e5f643/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":12982938,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-01-16T05:07:32.817Z","creator":{"name":"vetexgames","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":492735348,"name":"(READ DESCRIPTION) Pinewood Auditorium","desc":"","path":"/game/492735348-read-description-pinewood-auditorium","slug":"492735348-read-description-pinewood-auditorium","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/da32f7cf20ee5ff0a5174732a79f412897169841dbe6c261e39b48a1d59ad44f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7b3b7f9b4e958f6faae80101313442ed/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2423436897,"name":"Witching Hour","desc":"","path":"/game/2423436897-witching-hour","slug":"2423436897-witching-hour","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/23744888c6ce9429c5ceb